{
  "repo": "ARMOR-SERVER-AI",
  "ecosystem": "armor",
  "tagline": "It watches the cameras for movement while the house is armed, and only recommends.",
  "description": "ARMOR-SERVER-AI asks ARMOR-SERVER for the cameras and a tiny grey frame of each, measures the movement outside the zones to ignore, weighs it with the radar tracks and the light, and tells the server what it saw and why. It never acts: every decision carries authorizes_action = false. No detection model exists yet and nothing has run on a Jetson.",
  "columns": [
    "WHAT IT ASKS",
    "THE OBSERVATION SERVICE",
    "WHAT IT TELLS"
  ],
